#
# NexoraOS — package list for the live ISO (x86_64)
# -----------------------------------------------
# Every package here will be installed into the live root via pacman.
# ONLY official repo packages (core/extra/multilib) belong here.
# AUR-only packages are installable post-boot via Nexora Store (yay).
#
# Design rules:
#   - Keep total install under ~2.6 GB so the ISO stays <2 GB after squashfs.
#   - Default to lightweight components so RAM usage at idle stays <300 MB.
#   - Modern 2026 stack: Linux 6.x kernel, pipewire, wayland-ready (X11 default).
#   - Hardware coverage: 2009+ GPUs via mesa + xf86-video-* fallbacks.
#

